              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "بنزین زدن (benzin zadan) — \"to fill up (with petrol), to get petrol\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "قبل از سفر بنزین زدیم. Qabl az safar benzin zadim. We filled up before the trip."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "benzin + zadan. Present stem zan-: benzin mizanim — we fill up."
            }
          ]
        },
