              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "وسط جاده بنزین ما تمام شد. Vasat-e jâdde benzin-e mâ tamâm shod. Our petrol ran out in the middle of the road."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "tamâm 'complete, finished' + shodan. Tamâm kardan is to finish something."
